                      "name": "If you are using the Service on behalf o",
                      "context": "p",
                      "fill": "#6d6962",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": 42.25,
                      "content": "If you are using the Service on behalf of an organization, you represent that you have authority to bind that organization to these Terms, and “you” includes that organization.",
