                              "name": "You are responsible for keeping your acc",
                              "context": "p",
                              "fill": "#6d6962",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 63.38,
                              "content": "You are responsible for keeping your account credentials and API keys secure, for all activity that occurs under your account or keys, and for the accuracy of the information you provide (including billing details). Notify us immediately at hello@fromdxp.com if you suspect unauthorized use of an API key.",
