                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 63.38,
                              "content": "You may stop using the Service and close your account at any time. We may suspend or terminate your access, with or without notice, if we reasonably believe you have violated these Terms or applicable law, if required by law or a third-party request, to protect the Service or other users, or for prolonged inactivity.",
