                              "fill": "#6d6962",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 63.38,
                              "content": "On termination, your right to use the Service ends immediately. Sections that by their nature should survive (including credits already consumed, intellectual property, disclaimers, limitation of liability, indemnification, and governing law) will survive termination.",
