                          "content": "You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless PT DXP Global Inovasi and its affiliates from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising out of or related to (a) your use of the Service, (b) your Inputs or Outputs, (c) your violation of these Terms or applicable law, or (d) your violation of any third-party right. We may assume the exclusive defense and control of any matter subject to indemnification, in which case you agree to cooperate with our defense.",
