                              "fill": "#6d6962",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 63.38,
                              "content": "The parties will first try to resolve any dispute informally by contacting us at hello@fromdxp.com. If a dispute is not resolved within thirty (30) days, either party may pursue formal proceedings in a court of competent jurisdiction in Jakarta, Indonesia, except where applicable law requires a different forum or procedure.",
